/node_modules
/build
/.docusaurus

# package-lock.json IS COMMITTED, deliberately. It used to be ignored on this
# line, and that made the docs unbuildable in CI the moment a workflow was
# wired to them: the build runs `npm run ci` -> `npm ci --legacy-peer-deps`,
# and `npm ci` REFUSES to run without a lockfile. Worse, the ignore was silent
# — `git add docs/package-lock.json` skipped the file without a word, so the
# gap was invisible locally where node_modules already existed. Every other
# app in the fleet commits this file.
